<title>UK: Goodhead in talks to buy Rexam unit.</title>
<headline>Goodhead in talks to buy Rexam unit.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Goodhead Group Plc said on Monday that it was in advanced stages of negotiations to buy Benham and Company, the printing subsidiary of Rexam Plc.</p>
<p>The company said it would be consulting the employees of Benham before signing a definite agreeement.</p>
<p>Benham reported sales of 9.4 million stg in the year to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
